[ceiling] The flat underside of the brim shell is backed by 5 mm of mold stock. The current native slice emits Snug support and labelled interfaces in this annular band. Cut and detach supports through the open dry back before finishing the forming surfaces; the native slice establishes the emitted paths, while clean physical release remains untested.
